<title>UK: BNG sets C$100 million Eurobond due Dec 2002.</title>
<headline>BNG sets C$100 million Eurobond due Dec 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE   S19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.60     SPREAD	+24 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
